  "knowledge_gaps": [
    "The four-way comparison isolates residual and objective effects, but cannot establish whether multiple scales improve on the previously proposed five-item residual. Add that comparator before attributing gains to adaptive context scales.",
    "Reproduction remains underspecified: configuration order, exact checkpoint rule, tie handling, stopping thresholds, gate dimensions and budget reserves are deferred rather than fixed.",
